Package: shizuku-semi-auto
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: estebanalpha
Depends: android-tools
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Semi-automatic Shizuku activation via ADB loopback (Termux:Boot)
 Runs adb-connect and shizuku-watchdog at boot. Wireless mode (Android
 11+): after a one-time pairing, reconnects by itself, reading the port
 from a notification. Cable mode: detects "adb tcpip" from a second
 device, with optional USB priming that restores the user's USB mode.
 Version-aware Shizuku start (13.6+ libshizuku.so glob, V4+ user_de, V3.x
 sdcard). shizuku-setup configures everything interactively. Commands
 live in $PREFIX/bin; only Termux:Boot launchers are copied to $HOME.
